      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir whole kernel corn, cream-style corn, uncooked macaroni pasta, processed cheese, and butter together in a large bowl until well combined; transfer mixture into a casserole dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake, covered, in the preheated oven for 30 minutes. Uncover, stir, and continue baking until macaroni is tender but firm, about 30 minutes more.",
